{"data":{"body":"[P2] Flush nonterminal changes delivered after `onInvocationEnd` returns. For PENDING/RETRYING, `closed` remains false, so this schedules a record after the final drain/flush loop but returns without flushing buffered exporters; Lambda may freeze the environment before delivery. Track end processing and make late nonterminal changes await `drain(this)` and `flush()` before this hook resolves. Add an after-end test using a buffering exporter.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77HjjY","finding_digest":"242042ffb8c95e6213b7a9f045319d7710c5687ac0fb7d70ea40c18195bad32a","finding_id":"arf_v1_eqqef75yzfpgee5xvhyekmm5o4","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/index.ts::workflowinsightinvocation-onoperationchange::post-end-buffered-update-unflushed","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/index.ts::workflowinsightinvocation-onoperationchange::post-end-buffered-update-unflushed","line":1021,"observation_digest":"a3a2560d2a92a6b471da1579cfd787738b85fa1d18b947c91c5ed888adbc18c5","observation_id":"aro_v1_uorfmdjksktli4o2cv447v4hoo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/index.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:28:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fgtj7ee6zsmipyuxou77rfuolk","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"014319d7c71b8818d8dcada5c036ba0029f72dac","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1011,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_c36st2jr2l7kkk27o23b2lhxir","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:28:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
